title: "Paper 1: NL2SQL Ambiguity Detection"
abstract: >-
  A standalone research artifact for detecting and classifying ambiguity in
  natural-language-to-SQL questions. Includes the M1.5 ambiguity taxonomy,
  deterministic SignalAnnotator baseline, Human Gold evaluation set, and
  reproducible evaluation results.
